# Build context exclusions.
#
# The tests are the notable ones: they carry the contract suite and the
# fixtures, and none of it has any business in a production image.
.git
.gitignore
.github
node_modules
.next
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose*.yml
tests
justfile
*.md
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
.idea
.vscode